06:24.620 --> 06:25.450
Song Cai.

06:26.580 --> 06:28.330
Ternyata aku pernah melihatmu.

06:28.330 --> 06:29.950
Anak buah Zhang Ruipu.

06:31.150 --> 06:32.159
Babi...

06:33.970 --> 06:34.730
Babi...

06:36.400 --> 06:38.230
Dia mau bilang kantong semar.

06:39.390 --> 06:41.990
